title: "Agentic Systems for Root Cause Analysis: A Survey — Replication Package"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for the survey "Agentic Systems for Root Cause Analysis:
  A Survey". Contains the search protocol, the reviewed corpus of 30 papers
  (2023-2026), the D1-D10 rating rubric, and the per-system capability ratings.
